# glmark2's board run (glmark2(8), D183): the image esp-board-glmark2 runs its default benchmark off-screen at
# 800x600, as the reference on AbyssBSD was run (docs/boards/orangepi-6-plus/gl.md), until it ends
# (launcher.until=glmark2-offscreen), then reboots.
service glmark2-offscreen
program glmark2-es2-vectraos
arg --off-screen
arg -s
arg 800x600
mount /dev devmgr/dev
mount /lib/glmark2 bootfs/lib/glmark2
